# Fifth Element Ceramics — Cursor Rules

## Stack (strict)
- Vanilla HTML5, CSS3, ES6+ JavaScript only
- NO React, Vue, Webpack, Vite, npm, Node.js build tools
- Hosting: GitHub Pages (custom domain via CNAME)
- CMS: `/cms/simple-admin.html` — GitHub REST API + PAT in localStorage
- Data: `data/products.json`, `data/homepage.json`
- Media: `assets/uploads/` (images + short video loops)

## File conventions
- Public pages: `index.html`, `catalog.html`, `about.html`, `contact.html`
- Styles: `base.css` (reset + a11y), `style.css` (design tokens + components)
- Inline `<script>` at end of `<body>` — no external JS bundles
- Scripts must NOT block rendering; no `<script src>` in `<head>` without `defer`

## Data model (products)
```json
{
  "title": "string",
  "info": "string",
  "price": number,
  "height": "string",
  "category": "vases|pots|decor",
  "status": "В наличии|Продано|Под заказ",
  "image": "./assets/...",
  "media": [{ "type": "image|video", "src": "./assets/..." }]
}
```
- `image` is kept for backward compatibility (first image in `media`)
- `normalizeMedia()`: if `media` missing, migrate from `image`

## Security (mandatory)
- NEVER hardcode PAT tokens (`ghp_*`) — only OAuth client_id (public)
- Escape ALL JSON-derived strings before DOM insertion (`escapeHtml`, `escapeAttr`)
- Validate media URLs: only `./assets/...` relative paths on public site
- Use `textContent` for error messages, not raw `innerHTML`
- Use `data-*` attributes + event listeners, NOT inline `onclick` with user data
- GitHub API: use `githubFetch()` with retry on 403 rate-limit and 5xx

## Performance
- Images: `loading="lazy"`, `decoding="async"`, explicit `width`/`height`
- Videos: `muted playsinline preload="metadata"`, autoplay only for hero/loops
- Fontshare: `rel="preconnect"` to api.fontshare.com and cdn.fontshare.com
- Scroll listeners: `{ passive: true }`

## Accessibility
- Tap targets ≥ 44×44px for buttons and gallery dots
- Gallery: `role="tablist"`, `aria-selected`, keyboard ArrowLeft/ArrowRight
- Theme toggle: update `aria-label` on switch
- `:focus-visible` styles in base.css — do not remove

## CSS
- Use existing CSS variables from `:root` / `[data-theme]`
- Prefer `clamp()`, logical properties (`margin-inline`, `inset-block`), `oklch()`
- Do not add unused CSS; remove dead rules when refactoring

## CMS admin
- Image max: 5 MB; video max: 15 MB
- Allowed MIME: jpeg, png, webp, gif, mp4, webm
- UTF-8 base64: `encodeUTF8Base64` / `decodeUTF8Base64` (TextEncoder/TextDecoder)
- On save: write both `media[]` and `image` (first image src)

## Git / deploy
- `_headers` for Cloudflare Pages / Netlify (not native GitHub Pages)
- Do not commit `.env`, PAT files, or secrets
- Preserve 100% functionality when patching — minimal focused diffs
